# Leave empty in development: Vite proxies /api and /socket.io to the API (see vite.config.ts).
# Set when the web app and API are served from different origins, e.g. https://api.courtside.ph
VITE_API_URL=

# Where each app lives, for the links between them (owners who also play). Defaults: the dev servers.
VITE_PLAYER_APP_URL=
VITE_VENUE_APP_URL=
